      ":question/problem": "The table below summarizes the number of restaurants that offer outdoor seating and provide free Wi-Fi.\n\n|  | Provides free Wi-Fi | Does not provide free Wi-Fi |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| Has outdoor seating | $16$ | $4$ |\n| Does not have outdoor seating | $11$ | $9$ |\n\nIf one of these restaurants is selected at random, what is the probability that it **has outdoor seating but does not provide free Wi-Fi**?"
